and $z=3.98$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2.97,-0.02,3.98) & ≈-5+⟨3,-1,2⟩\\cdot ⟨2.97-3,-0.02,3.98-4⟩ \\\\  & =-5+⟨3,-1,2⟩\\cdot ⟨-0.03,-0.02,-0.02⟩ \\\\  & =-5-0.09+0.02-0.04 \\\\  & =-5.11\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518229 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186518230 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518229 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "15d3249d-d1cd-53bd-a1e4-e6f226addfa8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518229 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186125255 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518230 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186518238 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518230 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "22421f8f-e0e6-59b6-a0cb-85c1a6a1fe83" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518230 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186518157 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518238 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "34086e95-3db3-5bf8-9be4-2678ffe5730a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518238 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186518118 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518256 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186518229 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518256 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6536adc9-26a3-559e-813d-4e2a00fc2c8f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518256 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186518199 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518307 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186518256 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518307 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e047eab3-175f-5735-b074-16a1c776d03c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518307 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186489249 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
